{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>Yehudah, you — your brothers shall praise you.</b> An expression of cognate play with the name, meaning: they will praise you and honor you, and when they see that <b>your hand is on the neck of your enemies</b>, then <b>they shall bow down to you</b> as to a king. [Your hand on the neck of your enemies — his hand shall always be on the neck of his enemies.]"], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 49, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:09:09.392721383Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}